/-!
# Spheres in higher dimension, `SO(n)` and `U(n)`

Harmonic analysis on the real sphere `S^{n-1}` under `SO(n)` and on the complex sphere
`S^{2n-1}` under `U(n)`: zonal and Gegenbauer polynomials, the addition theorem, the Funk–Hecke
formula, branching, harmonics of bidegree `(p, q)` and disk polynomials, and the spherical
functions of the Gel'fand pairs `(SO(n), SO(n - 1))` and `(U(n), U(n - 1))`.
-/
